# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment

Copy this file to `TOOLS.md` locally (never commit `TOOLS.md`):

```bash
cp workspace-wp-publisher/TOOLS.md.example ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/TOOLS.md
```

WordPress credentials are loaded from **project config** (`projects/<slug>.json`) via `project_config.py`. Application passwords live in `~/.openclaw/credentials/wp/<slug>.pass` — see `projects/README.md`.

---

## Per-project WordPress (recommended)

| Key | Where |
|-----|--------|
| Site URL | `projects/<slug>.json` → `wordpress.url` |
| Username | `projects/<slug>.json` → `wordpress.user` |
| App password | `credentials/wp/<slug>.pass` (referenced by `wordpress.app_password_ref`) |
| Categories | Synced live: `python3 workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/sync_wp_categories.py --slug <slug>` |
| Fallback category | `projects/<slug>.json` → `wordpress.fallback_category_id` |
| Post status | `projects/<slug>.json` → `wordpress.default_status` |

---

## Example: Coinography

| Key | Placeholder value |
|-----|-------------------|
| **Site URL** | `https://your-crypto-news-site.com` |
| **Username** | `YOUR_WP_USERNAME@example.com` |
| **App Password** | Store in `~/.openclaw/credentials/wp/coinography.pass` |
| **Fallback Category ID** | `17` (Latest News — confirm in WP admin) |

---

## Pipeline artifact paths

| File | What it is |
|------|------------|
| `$RUN_DIR/article/raw.md` | Article from Writer |
| `$RUN_DIR/image/feature.jpg` | Feature image from Creator |
| `/tmp/<slug>-research.json` | Validated research JSON (includes `wp_category_ids`) |
| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |
| `/tmp/wp-error.log` | Error reason on failure |

---

## Skill scripts

- `skills/wordpress/publish.sh` — create draft/publish (reads project config + validated.json)
- `skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh` — update existing posts
